'''Chroma Gemstone''' is a [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing it from [[Mystery Box 1]] or through trading.

==Appearance==
It uses a large chromatic crystalline amethyst shard as its blade, which leads into the sword’s golden cross-guard with long quillons. In the center of the guard is a tiny color-alternating gemstone, along with another gemstone being present in the center of the handle’s curved golden pommel. The handle is brown in color with tape wrapped around it.

==Trivia== 
*It is the chroma counterpart of the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife under the name [[Gemstone]], which can be found in the same box.
*Its model derives from the limited Roblox gear [https://www.roblox.com/catalog/1678314358/Crystal-Blade-Amethyst-Attack Crystal Blade: Amethyst Attack]. However, it has been altered from a violet purple to a color-alternating texture.
*It was released along with the [[Season 1]] update.
*Like all the other [[Chroma Weapons]], it is not salvageable in the crafting station.
* This and [[Gemstone]] are the only Season 1 godlies not to be created by [[IDontHaveAUse]].
*Like many other [[Chroma Weapons]], it lost a lot of [[value]] due to being [[The Duping Glitch (2021)|duplicated]].
*There was a bug where if players equipped the [[Knifeception]] effect with this knife, small images of [[Hallow's Edge]] would appear. However, this has since been patched.

